  "description": "MoonshineAsr is a c# library for decoding moonshine's tiny, base Models，used in speech recognition (ASR), which uses Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime to decode the ONNX model at the bottom layer,  This library boasts excellent compatibility in terms of framework adaptation, supporting multiple environments such as net461+, net60+, netcoreapp3.1, and netstandard2.0+. It supports cross-platform compilation as well as AOT compilation, and is simple and convenient to use.",
